      "text": "UNEXPLAINED\nRewrite the PR template during source-cache extraction\n\nThe delta replaces the change-tree image/fallback guidance, removes Reading order, and adds a Visuals section. Read reason and evidence ↗",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
